# ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a principal software architect, senior full-stack engineer, AI product engineer, WebGL developer, cybersecurity engineer, UI/UX director, and hackathon product strategist.

Build a production-minded, extensible web application called:

NEXORA — Intelligence Beyond Search

Tagline:
"Explore the web. Understand the universe. Control your digital world."

The application must combine an immersive, cinematic universe interface with a functional AI-powered search experience, research tools, financial analytics, and a modular plugin architecture.

This is not a static landing page, a design mockup, or a collection of non-functional buttons.

The objective is to create a polished, demonstrable hackathon prototype that can be deployed on Vercel and extended into a real product.

Prioritize:
1. Visual quality.
2. Functional core features.
3. Reliable application architecture.
4. Real integrations where available.
5. Performance and accessibility.
6. Security.
7. Future extensibility.
8. A compelling hackathon demonstration.

Do not claim that the application is production-ready merely because it compiles.

Do not claim that external integrations work unless they have been implemented and tested.

Do not stop after generating the home page.

Build the actual application, including its routes, components, API endpoints, loading states, error states, configuration, and deployment documentation.

